# A local fnox config may hold values in plain text. These are every name fnox
# reads (local and per-profile files included); only the encrypted store is
# tracked, and nix/checks.nix fails on any other store or any non-ciphertext.
fnox.toml
.fnox.toml
fnox.*.toml
.fnox.*.toml
!/secrets/fnox.toml
